                            <comment id="16730708" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Sat, 29 Dec 2018 14:14:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
The H2 connection leak is fixed. Unfortunately we have to add two collections of &lt;tt&gt;Connection&lt;/tt&gt;  to track opened connections.&lt;br/&gt;
It may be cause of a little performance drop. May be it makes sense to run the benchmarks.&lt;br/&gt;
Also the new class &lt;tt&gt;AbstractIndexingCommonTest&lt;/tt&gt; is used as the base class for the most tests in the &lt;b&gt;indexing&lt;/b&gt; module to check all H2 connection are closed at the end of the test.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16738309" author="ignitetcbot" created="Wed, 9 Jan 2019 14:55:35 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
