                            <comment id="16740305" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Fri, 11 Jan 2019 11:34:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, fixed. Heap dump creation is turn off. I add the comment with recommendation to use heap dump to investigate the problem if the check failed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
